      "category": "mcu",
      "deviceModel": "esp32s3.soc",
      "summary": "Dual-core Xtensa LX7 at 240 MHz, 16 MB flash (W25Q128), 8 MB octal PSRAM (GPIO33–37 are taken by it). USB-C goes straight to the S3's native USB (GPIO19/20); PinBench reads the console on UART0, so build with ARDUINO_USB_CDC_ON_BOOT=0.",
