      "summary": "240×240 round IPS module on the header — wiring chosen by PinBench, edit to match yours: CLK GPIO40, DIN GPIO41, CS GPIO39, DC GPIO38, RST GPIO42, BL GPIO1. GPIO38–42 are also camera lines, so leave the camera unfitted. VCC 3.3 V.",
