        "note": "Elatec Simple Protocol, ASCII mode: hex command + CR, hex reply + CR. SearchTag is \"050010\"."
      },
      "summary": "Elatec TWN4 MultiTech 3 LF/HF OEM board (125 kHz + 13.56 MHz, NFC) on UART1 at TTL level: ESP TX GPIO17 → TWN4 RXD, TWN4 TXD → ESP RX GPIO16. Needs a 5 V supply (4.3–5.5 V, ~120 mA) and a shared GND. Present a card from the IN panel.",
